'''Little Warriors''' (リトル軍隊, ''Ritoru Guntai'', '''Little Army''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

