==Trivia==
*This combo used to contain [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Masai Cat]], but due to it being a Non-[[:Category:Removed Combos|Removed Cat Combo]] with two [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|gacha]] units, it was removed. Notably, Li'ls and Normal Cats officially aren't counted as gacha units.

